<?xml version="1.0"?>
<body language="English">
	<row id="msg_0695_00000" index="0">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Gina</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0695_00001" index="1">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Whenever I see a strong Hustler,\nI wanna be their cheerleader.\rWhen I’m out on a walk,\nI pick stuff up sometimes.\rIf I find anythin’, it’s yours!\rWanna gimme your number?\nI’ll call whenever I get somethin’.{YESNO 0}</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0695_00002" index="2">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">I’ll call as soon as I get somethin’!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0695_00003" index="3">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Fr? Well, I’m still cheerin’\nfor you!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0695_00004" index="4">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">If I find a item, it’s yours!\nWanna gimme your number?{YESNO 0}</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0695_00005" index="5">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">You FINALLY here!\nI think this gon’ make you happy.\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0695_00006" index="6">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">You must REALLY like phone calls to be\nright nearby and still callin’!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0695_00007" index="7">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Me and my {STRVAR_1 0, 10, 0} gettin’ more\nin sync with each other.\rWe scrapped a wild {STRVAR_1 0, 11, 0} and\nbarely beat it.\fWe gettin’ in the groove!\rBye! Let’s chat again!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0695_00008" index="8">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Me and my {STRVAR_1 0, 10, 0} gettin’ more\nin sync with each other.\rBut, you know what?\rI STILL ain’t caught {STRVAR_1 0, 11, 0}.\nIt’s gettin’ beyond frustratin’...\rBye! Let’s chat again!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0695_00009" index="9">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Would you be my practice partner again\nsometime?\rI’ll be waitin’ on {STRVAR_1 4, 3, 0}...\rCould you go a lil easier on\nme next time?</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0695_00010" index="10">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">How soon you comin’?\nDon’t forget, {STRVAR_1 4, 3, 0}!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0695_00011" index="11">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">How soon you comin’?\nDon’t forget, {STRVAR_1 4, 3, 0}!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0695_00012" index="12">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">My bad, I ain’t found nothin’ useful\nyet... If I find anythin’, you\fcan have it!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0695_00013" index="13">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">I picked up somethin’ nice today.\nI want you to have it, so I called!\rYou gon’ come get it, right?\n{STRVAR_1 4, 3, 0} is where I’m at.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0695_00014" index="14">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">I’m gettin’ REAL impatient waitin’ to\ngive you my present!\rHurry over to {STRVAR_1 4, 3, 0}!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0695_00015" index="15">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">You heard about The Feds?\rThey done raided the Radio Tower in\nGoldenrod. With a WARRANT.\rIs the people inside OK?</language>
	</row>
</body>
